  doi = {10.1109/CCIC68129.2026.11485997},
  abstract = {The Accident Detection and Alert System rely on the concept of deep learning with the integration of the YOLOv8 and YOLOv9 models, thus enabling the possibility of accident detection in real time with high accuracy. The project is distinguished by its convenient user interface, which facilitates the process of registration, login, and uploading of images and Python and Flask programming languages, which serve the background operations. Initially, the YOLOv8 model is used in accident detection via image uploading, and with the purpose of achieving greater accuracy, the integration of the YOLOv9 model acts as an improvement in terms of performance. Once the accident occurs, the system automatically triggers and sends an email notification to the admin with the image and accident details. If none of this happens, the users will obtain notification via the interface. With the integration of the efficiency of YOLOv8 and the accuracy of YOLOv9 models, this project ensures consistency in its performance regarding traffic monitoring and management, emergencies, and security in cities. © 2026 IEEE.},
